  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Harley-Davidson grew to more than five times its starting value, far ahead of this set. The US share basket roughly doubled. Wal-Mart, despite its dramatic retail success at the start, finished close to cash. A familiar business success story was not a promise of the highest stock return.",
    "source_ids": [
