      "hubble-repair"
    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "The Gulf War was ending, stocks were rising, and Wal-Mart had passed Sears. Workers and companies still faced a weak economy.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Different companies produced very different returns. Harley-Davidson’s large gain came with sharp monthly falls as well as rises. The final total hides that bumpy journey.",
    "what_faded_away": "A retailer’s sales ranking did not settle its investment ranking. A single month’s rally also could not explain the next five years.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Harley-Davidson’s eventual lead was unknown. Choosing it with the finished chart in hand is much easier than choosing it amid a labor dispute.",
